                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "content",
                  "textContent": "<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\">Find Your Sound</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Explore instruments and music-making essentials for every step of your musical journey</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "position": 1,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "content",
                  "textContent": "<h2>Gear for Every Musician</h2>\n<p>From your first practice session to the stage or studio, find the instruments and essentials to bring your ideas to life. Explore a thoughtfully chosen range for making music your own.</p>\n<ul>\n    <li>Instruments for beginners and experienced players</li>\n    <li>Accessories for practice, performance, and recording</li>\n    <li>Gear to help you shape your sound</li>\n</ul>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text-teaser",
              "position": 2,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "content",
                  "textContent": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Make Music Your Way</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><i>Discover the instruments and essentials that inspire your next song</i></p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text-two-column",
              "position": 3,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "left",
                  "textContent": "<h3>Start with the Essentials</h3>\n<p>Build a setup that fits your musical goals, with instruments and accessories for learning, regular practice, and exploring new sounds.</p>"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "right",
                  "textContent": "<h3>Ready for the Next Stage</h3>\n<p>Find reliable gear for rehearsals, live performances, and studio recording, so you can share your sound wherever your music takes you.</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "html",
              "position": 4,
              "slots": []
