            },
            {
              "type": "image-text",
              "position": 1,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "right",
                  "textContent": "<h2>Gear for Every Sound</h2>\n<p>From expressive guitars and keyboards to the accessories that keep you performance-ready, discover gear to help bring your musical ideas to life.</p>\n<p>Find trusted essentials for practice, recording, and taking your sound to the stage.</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "image-text",
              "position": 2,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "left",
                  "textContent": "<h2>Build Your Musical Setup</h2>\n<p>Whether you're choosing your first instrument or adding to a well-loved setup, find options to suit your style and way of playing.</p>\n<p>Pair instruments with practical accessories and make every practice session more rewarding.</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "center-text",
              "position": 3,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "center",
                  "textContent": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">Make Music Your Way</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">From first notes to studio sessions and live performances, explore the instruments and essentials that help you create, play, and share your sound.</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "image-text-bubble",
              "position": 4,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "left-text",
                  "textContent": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Practice with Confidence</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Choose beginner-friendly instruments and useful accessories to make getting started feel inspiring.</p>"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "center-text",
                  "textContent": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Shape Your Sound</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Explore versatile instruments and gear to bring your musical ideas to life.</p>"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "right-text",
                  "textContent": "<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Ready for the Stage</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Find performance essentials that help you play with confidence wherever the music takes you.</p>"
