              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "content",
                  "textContent": "<h1 style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 2.5em; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Find Your Sound</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 1.2em; color: #666; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;\">Explore instruments, accessories, and music-making essentials for practice, recording, and live performance.</p>"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text-two-column",
              "position": 1,
              "slots": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "left",
                  "textContent": "<h2>Explore Music Gear</h2>\n<p>Discover the essentials that help bring your music to life, from first notes to finished performances:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Instruments</strong> - Guitars, keyboards, drums, and more</li>\n<li><strong>Accessories</strong> - Picks, strings, stands, and cables</li>\n<li><strong>Recording</strong> - Microphones, interfaces, and studio gear</li>\n<li><strong>Sound</strong> - Amplifiers, speakers, and headphones</li>\n<li><strong>Performance</strong> - Live sound and stage essentials</li>\n<li><strong>Learning</strong> - Helpful tools for practice and progress</li>\n</ul>"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "slot": "right",
                  "textContent": "<h2>Gear for Every Musician</h2>\n<p>Browse music products suited to different needs, setups, and stages of your journey:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Beginner Gear</strong> - Accessible essentials for getting started</li>\n<li><strong>Performance Gear</strong> - Reliable equipment for rehearsals and shows</li>\n<li><strong>Studio Gear</strong> - Tools for recording and creating at home</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin-top: 16px; color: #666;\">Explore each category to find the gear that fits your sound.</p>"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
